	)
	(text "Backlight: 3 white LEDs in parallel from VBAT_SW via 20 R (25-60 mA over the cell range), PWM on LCD_BL.\nPanel logic 3.3 V. Pot wiper -> GPIO34 (ADC1_CH6)."
